----------------------------------------------------------------------
  DESIGN: Staggered First Switch Design (SFSD)
----------------------------------------------------------------------
  The design is not a classical DID design, a staggered adoption
  design, or an heterogeneous adoption design. On the other hand, it
  is a staggered first switch design: some groups share the same
  baseline treatment but experience their first treatment switch at
  different dates.

  First switches occur between t=2008 and t=2021.

  Estimator: did_multiplegt_dyn

  See Chapter 8 of the DID textbook.
